    <div class="partner-copy">
      <p>Our production capabilities span corporate video production, social media videography, campaign films, photography, event coverage and live streaming. We can scale the production approach according to the brief, whether that means a lean social shoot, an ongoing content production model or a larger campaign involving talent, locations and multiple deliverables.</p>

      <p>With teams and production networks across Singapore and Kuala Lumpur, we also manage cross-border productions for brands operating across both markets. From crew and talent coordination to locations, schedules and on-ground logistics, LOKi takes ownership of the production process so clients can work through one team across markets.</p>
